["<task-notification>\n<task-id>a2aac5b63a47cb6f6</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01CKAobuTNXaLsG11G6DRRSV</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-youxun-project-agent-eval/07ac599c-2761-4651-b18d-ea374efd5f2b/tasks/a2aac5b63a47cb6f6.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"T-UP extension upstream fixes\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>## T-UP complete: X1–X8 implemented, committed, all gates green\n\n### Files changed (commit `03bede5` on `feat/agent-eval-graphiti`)\n- `src/handlers/graphiti-auto-sync.ts` — X1 (`computeReferenceTime`), X2 (`graphitiAutoSync` gate), X3 (`graphiti.write` event)\n- `src/handlers/graphiti-prefetch.ts` — X2 (`graphitiPrefetch` gate)\n- `src/tools/graphiti-tool.ts` — X3 (`graphiti.search_result` event), X7 (query rewrite before search), `GraphitiSearchOutcome.facts`\n- `src/tools/memory-search-tool.ts` — X4 (empty-store fix), X7 (delegates to shared rewrite core), X8 (`memory.search_result` event)\n- `src/tools/memory-tool.ts` — X5 (`AGENT_EVAL_SOURCE_SESSION_ID` primary, legacy fallback + warn)\n- `src/tools/query-rewrite.ts` (new) — shared `runQueryRewrite()` extracted from `rewriteMemorySearchQuery`\n- `src/config.ts`, `src/types.ts`, `src/constants.ts` — new config keys/defaults, X7 prompt constant (verbatim)\n- `scripts/observability-capability-evidence.ts` + `tests/observability/capability-evidence.test.ts` — X6, two new capabilities: `extension: graphiti_events.v1`, `extension: search_rewrite_events.v1`\n- `tests/handlers/graphiti-auto-sync.test.ts`, `tests/handlers/graphiti-prefetch.test.ts`, `tests/tools/graphiti-tool.test.ts`, `tests/tools/memory-search-tool.test.ts`, `tests/tools/memory-tool.test.ts` — new tests for X1,X2,X3,X4,X5,X7,X8\n\n### Gates\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` → exit 0,